@startuml Device Registration
title ESP Device Registration

actor Admin
participant "Admin App" as AdminApp
participant "Docker Container" as Docker
participant "esp-prepare" as Prepare
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB
participant "ESP Device" as ESP

Admin -> AdminApp: Select USB port and firmware version
Admin -> AdminApp: Click "Register Device"
AdminApp -> Docker: Launch esp-prepare container

Docker -> Prepare: Execute prepare script
Prepare -> Prepare: Generate MAC and secret
Prepare -> Prepare: Create SPIFFS files with credentials

Prepare -> API: POST /api/admin/esp/create\n{MAC, secret}
API -> API: Validate admin token
API -> DB: Create device with sensors/actuators
DB -> API: Device created

Prepare -> Prepare: Download firmware
Prepare -> ESP: Flash firmware and SPIFFS to device
ESP -> ESP: Reboot with new firmware

Prepare -> AdminApp: Flash completed successfully
AdminApp -> Admin: Show success dialog

@enduml
